From 6fdc34686e6ad1971adc8321deb999f2a1e0912e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruben van der Linde <ruben@conduction.nl>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:23:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(hermiq): check project keys in the kernel, not
 through MemoryService [skip ci]

SessionController called the static MemoryService::isProjectKey(), the
only direct use of MemoryService from outside the Service component. That
exposed the whole class across components and dropped the overall
maintainability estimate to 3.75, below the app's floor of 3.77.

The rule now lives in Kernel\ProjectKey::isValid(); MemoryService keeps
isProjectKey() and delegates to it, so behaviour is unchanged. The merged
tree measures 3.77 again. Adds ProjectKeyTest and the UsesClass metadata
for the two tests that now run the helper.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
